Me, I never wish from magic lamps until I've found two.  Permanent light is
*so* handy that I prefer to hold on to it (I'd use a wand wish to get a magic
lamp, if I could).  Plus, even with a blessed lamp, there's a 20% chance that
you'll get no wish at all.

On the other hand, in the early game, a wish can be mighty handy.  You should
look at the wishing spoiler:

http://home.in.tum.de/~traykovs/nethack/wishing-342.txt

In your case, I'd probably hold on to the lamp until I felt a really pressing
need to wish for something specific.  If you're really itching to wish for
something, I'd go for a nice set of DSM (probably gray) or gauntlets of power.

